{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"afad04fa858c90547ef68f1ed50264630e8fbc37cb09346f9e141dda23cbe797","ja":"王道か個性か","zh":"主流还是个性？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2ef012dde9a1a40fb04455072f542cfc19446eefc3bda65c4510bdadbc4cbc92","ja":"スウィーティー、スウィーティー……\nかわいらしいものとか愛らしいもの……かしら～？","zh":"甜心、甜心……\n是可爱或者讨人喜欢的东西……吧～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"dadf04a8c2bba150a026dcdd2d29dee38028ae66a9f8eaad347ecb160d0783ff","ja":"雑貨屋さんなら、何かあると思ったんですけど……。\nでも、なかなかピンとくるものが……。","zh":"本以为杂货店的话会有些收获的……\n但实在很难找到让人眼前一亮的东西……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"95d367bea4351b6e496d63cdd478f88066b3873ae55717526cc8301e06e168fb","ja":"あ、ピピピーンってきちゃいました♪\nスウィーティーなキーホルダーがありましたよ！","zh":"啊，我灵光一闪了♪\n找到了一个甜美可爱的钥匙扣哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4356b701c275843a48a5a016acee334c61ca7d024a77e6108af087c735fa3c5b","ja":"ショッキングピンクのハート？\n……うふふ、インパクトは抜群ね♪","zh":"荧光粉红色的爱心？\n……呵呵，冲击力拔群呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c112702f8f8601f4240f525208548639ebde4c964664794685f1764ae533fa90","ja":"真ん中のマスコットは、なんの動物なんだろう？\n……そもそも、動物なのかな？","zh":"中间的吉祥物是什么动物呢？\n……话说回来，真的是动物吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c8bdafe1a784823939fa369308668723508806e4bd947516918a3b9219080c9d","ja":"私もわからないです♪　でもすっごくスウィーティーな\n感じがしませんか？　表情とか首の傾き具合とか！","zh":"我也不太清楚呢♪ 不过不觉得超级甜美\n可爱吗？比如表情还有歪头的角度！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e55e54200402e8d0e6e65d09bbc13c051295dfea41d9820e48e64fdb06ba2c73","ja":"じーっと見てると、なんだか山の稜線みたいに\nのびのびしたラインで、かわいいですよ♪","zh":"凝神看去的话，总觉得像山峦的棱线一样，\n线条舒展自如，十分可爱呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"512570225f1af75b559d8c58cea6c6e286a9ba7ef9ebd9516993490110f19ea9","ja":"マスコットに対する評価として合ってるのかしら……？\nでも、時間もないし……。","zh":"拿来评价吉祥物到底合不合适呢……？\n不过，也没时间了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"82607b6e520c9172b9f8b8b7e65874ecba0d78a8ae9d960f2c1ca3a9bca842f8","ja":"でもさすがに奇をてらいすぎな気が……。\nあ、『スウィーティー』って言えば……！","zh":"但总感觉有点太标新立异了……\n啊，要是叫“甜心”的话……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"9b299a02cb5d697a1e07cf0fdd17731c1e971942c9bbdf96e3e3c86f52e42166","ja":"「結果発表～！　では買ってきたものを\n発表してください！　まずはcharming組から！」","zh":"“公布结果～！那么请展示买回来的\n东西吧！首先从charming组开始！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c96bb71c8dced6230ae6e35411884612692804cd5acfb1d52e0e606a952f43a8","ja":"私たちは……これ、オルゴールです♪\n黄色い花が散りばめられているんですよ。","zh":"我们的是……这个，是八音盒♪\n上面点缀着黄色的花朵呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"1f8b8221a69ac5519957a9e8052827a9e1c37008bcbffa4e5615fd94c663bd38","ja":"私たちは、果物のスウィーティーです♪\n時間ギリギリに、果物屋さんにかけこみました♪","zh":"我们是水果甜葡萄柚哦♪\n赶在最后一刻跑进了水果店♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"d14b68000303031dec230c7d31572d2fa28f57cc5f2e02acc8cab6ecd1837945","ja":"ふふ♪　たしかに、『スウィーティー』ね！\nストレートでとってもわかりやすいわ！","zh":"呵呵♪　确实很“甜美”呢！\n直截了当，非常通俗易懂！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"d6ccab7525c4ece2a447d339b6a33263ed596c349cc5f5c59b6955d7a51f73ab","ja":"そうだネ……あれ？　マミ、どうかしたノ？","zh":"是啊……咦？真美，你怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1709.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"e2dd9e4605c9f0ac0f329d3cbf7a172ac37a56525922a4ea71e759d25bb875b2","ja":"むー……やっぱり真美が選んだのでも\n対決した～いっ！！","zh":"唔——……果然还是好想用\n真美选的曲子来对决啊～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
